[Unit]
Description=Chromium successfully launched and cdp is up
# Pure "CDP is up" signal only. cdp-ready-check.sh starts this target once
# Chromium's debugging endpoint is reachable, and chromium-kiosk.service stops it
# on exit. It intentionally pulls in no services: feral-controld is now
# CDP-optional with self-reconnect and is started explicitly by
# .start-services.sh (units are never enabled, so [Install] alone starts nothing);
# its lifecycle must not be coupled to Chromium readiness.
